flowchart TD
    U[User: fictional preferences] --> UI[Browser interface]
    UI --> Q[Questionnaire state]
    Q --> R[Rule-based risk inference]
    R -->|category / conflict| P[Profile + clarification screen]
    P -->|edit answer| Q
    P -->|continue if ready| S[Fictional scenario selector]
    S --> D[Static portfolio examples]
    D --> C[Risk-category comparator]
    R --> C
    C --> V[Standard or inspectable advice view]
    V -->|why / switch mode| V
    V -->|accept or decline| F[Decision feedback]
    F --> H[In-memory session event history]
    F -->|reconsider| V
    UI -->|reset| Q
    classDef built fill:#e6f6ed,stroke:#28785d,color:#163f34;
    classDef simulated fill:#fff2df,stroke:#b58329,color:#5c400d;
    class U,UI,Q,R,P,C,V,F,H built;
    class S,D simulated;
